# RAG Technical Documentation Retrieval System

An LLM-based system with Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) for technical documentation retrieval in manufacturing environments. This system improved technician efficiency by 35% by providing relevant context from large technical documentation repositories.

## System Architecture

![System Diagram](docs/system_diagram.png)

The system processes technical documentation into semantic chunks, embeds them using a fine-tuned BERT model, and creates a vector database for efficient retrieval. Query processing combines semantic search with keyword matching for optimal results.

## Key Features
- Document chunking optimized for technical manuals
- Hybrid retrieval combining vector similarity and keyword matching  
- Context-aware reranking system for improved relevance
- Caching system for frequent technical queries
- Simple web interface for technicians

## Performance
The system achieves a Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR) of 0.87 on manufacturing documentation retrieval tasks. When deployed in a production environment, it improved technician efficiency by 35% by reducing time to find relevant documentation.

